  "statement": "\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eUse your calculator to evaluate the expression.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e14 \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_16025\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/divide.gif\"\u003e 7 + 30 \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_16026\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/divide.gif\"\u003e 6\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e",
